## How It Works

1. **Search** for any movie using TMDB's extensive database
2. **Rate** it on a precise 0.0–10.0 scale and write a review
3. **Reveal** — your friends' blurred reviews unlock only after you've rated the film
4. **Earn** Popcorn Kernels for every rating and review you submit

No more second-guessing yourself after reading someone else's take first.

---

## Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Blurred Reviews** | Friend reviews are hidden behind a blur until you watch and rate the film — the core of TrueReview |
| **Popcorn Kernels** | Gamified reward system — earn points for rating (+1) and reviewing (+5) films |
| **Watched & Watchlist** | Track what you've seen with ratings and reviews, and queue up what's next with priority flags and streaming links |
| **Viewing Goals** | Set goals around actors, directors, franchises, or custom lists and track your progress |
| **Social System** | Follow friends, browse their profiles and watched history, and discover new films through their taste |
| **User Search** | Fuzzy search with real-time results and follow-status indicators |
| **Stats Dashboard** | Rating distributions, genre breakdowns, total watched count, and personal favorites |
| **Profile Customization** | Profile pictures, display names, bios, and custom background images |
| **NSFW Moderation** | Uploaded images are automatically screened using TensorFlow.js |
| **Admin Panel** | User management, impersonation, role assignment, and moderation tools |

---

## Tech Stack

```
Backend       Node.js · Express 5 · PostgreSQL
Auth          bcrypt · express-session · connect-pg-simple
APIs          TMDB (movie data) · Nodemailer (password resets)
Moderation    TensorFlow.js · NSFWjs
Media         Sharp (image optimization) · Multer (uploads)
Frontend      Vanilla HTML · CSS · JavaScript
Security      Rate limiting · parameterized queries · bcrypt hashing
```

