## Local Development

> **Prerequisites:** Node.js v24+ and npm 11+

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-username/TrueReview.git
cd TrueReview

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start the server
npm start
```

Then open **http://localhost:3000** in your browser.

> **Note:** You will need to configure environment variables for PostgreSQL, TMDB API key, and email service credentials. See `.env.example` if available.

